  description: A creature you touch regains a number of hit points equal to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier (fixed at +3 for this sample -- see header comment). This spell has no effect on undead or constructs. When cast using a higher-level slot, healing increases by 1d8 per slot level above 1st.
